        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Eden ramgai khou tei lung khang,",
            "Guang nimei tingmik naguang the;",
            "Panti luaina tatpui nung kiu,",
            "Guangtang puni kauh kaidai khou.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Alungning le abumang hei,",
            "Tingkauh ram khou ruanna tatbam;",
            "Nban ram khou hei lung nimak ge,",
            "Tat kan dikho jianmei nun le.",
            "",
            "2. Mangthang hougaimei khang suang e,",
            "Laujiu nah +:1 gan na bam e;",
            "Mang man ritho kagan mak khe,",
            "Jaipat lou ni pou Khrista +:1.",
            "",
            "3. Kauh ramgai tang mak khang lunggei,",
            "Jingmei muang +:1 gum liam bam e;",
            "Gan guang datro kanloumei pu,",
            "Ringmei thinglim khou jang suni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
